# =============================================================================
# Mission -- dispatch one unit of work to one machine.
# =============================================================================
# Served at /machines/<machine_id>/execute_mission.
#
# This is an action rather than a topic or a service because a mission already
# has exactly the shape an action has: it is accepted or rejected up front, it
# runs for a long time, it reports progress while it runs, it can be cancelled,
# and it ends in exactly one terminal outcome. A service call would block for
# the whole mission; a topic would give no acknowledgement and no result.
#
# It maps 1:1 onto the OS lifecycle:  Dispatch -> Running -> Completed | Exception
# =============================================================================

# ---- Goal -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Assigned by the OS. Echoed back in MachineState.current_mission_id so the
# fleet view and the mission view can be joined without guessing.
string mission_id

# The capability this mission needs, matched against MachineState.capabilities.
# Sent even though the OS already matched on it, so the machine can refuse work
# it cannot do rather than trusting the dispatcher blindly.
string capability_required

# Human-readable statement of intent, e.g. "clean aisle 3".
string objective

# Everything type-specific, as a JSON object string. This is the escape hatch
# that keeps the interface stable: a new machine type invents new keys in here
# instead of new fields in this file.
string parameters_json
---
# ---- Result -----------------------------------------------------------------
uint8 RESULT_COMPLETED = 0
uint8 RESULT_EXCEPTION = 1
uint8 result_state

# Machine-readable failure code, e.g. "OBSTACLE_DETECTED". Empty on success.
string error_code

# Human-readable summary of how it went, for logs and operators.
string message

# Type-specific results, as a JSON object string. Mirrors parameters_json.
string result_json
---
# ---- Feedback ---------------------------------------------------------------
uint8 progress_percent
string status_message
